- ✅ Input path: `FileInputFormat.addInputPath(job, new Path(args[0]))`.
- ✅ Output path: `FileOutputFormat.setOutputPath(job, new Path(args[1]))`.
- ✅ **Delete the output directory before re-running** to avoid "Output directory already exists" error.
- ✅ HDFS commands: `hadoop fs -put <local> <hdfs>`, `hadoop fs -cat <hdfs>`, `hadoop fs -ls <hdfs>`.

